    "body": "Per the documentation, the shell defaults to `STARSHIP_SHELL`, which would be xonsh in your case. Changing the default would be a breaking change, which is why this change won't happen until the next major release.\r\n\r\nApart from that, this looks like the same issue as https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/4341, so I am going to close this as a duplicate to keep all the discussions in the same place.",
